#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:156 fa6e4251eb864cd28ff6ceb8f36d0c0c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for patent application overviews using a query "
"string of the format "
"'applicationMetaData.inventionTitle:your\\_search\\_term', where "
"your\\_search\\_term is the case-insensitive keyword or keyphrase you are"
" searching for. If your\\_search\\_term is a multi-word phrase, it must "
"be encased in escaped double quotation marks for exact matching. This "
"tool allows for sorting, offsetting, and filterin of results. Returns a "
"list of important metadata fields for each application, including "
"application number, filing date, grant date, invention title, and CPC "
"classifications."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：使用格式为 `applicationMetaData.inventionTitle:your_search_term` "
"的查询字符串搜索专利申请概览，其中 your_search_term 是您要搜索的大小写不敏感的关键词或短语。如果 "
"your_search_term "
"是多词短语，必须使用转义的双引号括起来以实现精确匹配。该工具支持结果的排序、偏移和筛选。返回每个申请的重要元数据字段列表，包括申请号、申请日期、授权日期、发明名称及"
" CPC 分类。"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:160 e93258883c894930b1e93703c8294ae4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Keyword or keyphrase to search for in the "
"patent application title. This field is required."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（可选）用于在专利申请标题中搜索的关键词或关键短语。此字段为必填项。"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:163 479a9937387847439ba25cfaa63b7600
msgid ""
"``exact_match`` (boolean) (optional) If true, the search will only return"
" results that exactly match the provided query. Default is false."
msgstr "``exact_match``（布尔值）（可选）如果为 true，搜索将仅返回与提供的查询完全匹配的结果。默认值为 false。"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:166 de9dbd8a6bb047a981ebddfd5d69e27c
msgid ""
"``sort`` (string) (optional) Sorts results by one of the following "
"fields: filingDate or grantDate. Follow the field name with a space and "
"'asc' or 'desc' for ascending or descending by date, respectively. For "
"example: 'filingDate desc'"
msgstr ""
"``sort``（字符串）（可选） 按以下字段之一对结果进行排序：filingDate 或 "
"grantDate。字段名称后跟一个空格及“asc”或“desc”，分别表示按日期升序或降序。例如：'filingDate desc'"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:169 2449b567081b40519dff772196b0affa
msgid ""
"``offset`` (integer) (optional) The starting position (zero-indexed) of "
"the result set. Default is 0."
msgstr "``offset``（整数）（可选）结果集的起始位置（从零开始计数）。默认值为0。"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:172 f2d39d630dc644abb182723f69c4d3e1
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) The maximum number of results to return. "
"Default is 25."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选） 返回的最大结果数量。默认值为25。"

#: ../../tools/uspto_tools.rst:175 2e15d783bc72455e846433a6de08f4bd
msgid ""
"``rangeFilters`` (string) (optional) Limits results to the date range "
"specified for one of the following fields: filingDate or grantDate. "
"Provide the field name, a space, and a colon-separated start and end "
"value in YYYY-MM-DD format. For example: 'grantDate "
"2010-01-01:2011-01-01'"
msgstr ""
"``rangeFilters``（字符串）（可选）限制结果在以下字段之一指定的日期范围内：filingDate 或 "
"grantDate。请提供字段名称、一个空格，以及用冒号分隔的起始和结束日期，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD。例如：'grantDate "
"2010-01-01:2011-01-01'"

